  <h1>Visual forms that reveal the relationship<span class="red-stop">.</span></h1>
  <p class="page-lede">We design charts, diagrams, maps, timelines and frameworks that help an audience see comparison, change, cause, sequence, risk and the connections inside a complex system.</p>
